; keep: Back/Forward show kept pages at once (test/amiga/keep.host);
; then with Velox/KeepPages 1 the oldest kept page gives way.  No memory
; may be lost.
Echo >VELOX:r/keep.txt "keep"
; warm-up run (one-time OS allocations: fonts, CLI, ...)
Run >NIL: VELOX:velox http://127.0.0.1:8080/second.html
Wait 4
Status >ENV:vpid COMMAND=VELOX:velox
Break $vpid C
Wait 2
Delete >NIL: ENV:vpid
Avail >NIL: FLUSH
Echo >>VELOX:r/keep.txt "mem_before " NOLINE
Avail >>VELOX:r/keep.txt TOTAL
Echo >VELOX:r/keep.start ""
VELOX:velox http://127.0.0.1:8080/form.html LOG=VELOX:r/keep.log
Echo >>VELOX:r/keep.txt "exit rc=$RC"
Avail >NIL: FLUSH
Echo >>VELOX:r/keep.txt "mem_after " NOLINE
Avail >>VELOX:r/keep.txt TOTAL
SetEnv Velox/KeepPages 1
VELOX:velox http://127.0.0.1:8080/form.html LOG=VELOX:r/keep2.log
Echo >>VELOX:r/keep.txt "exit2 rc=$RC"
Delete >NIL: ENV:Velox/KeepPages
Echo >>VELOX:r/keep.txt "done"
